`)}function Yee(){return["## Phase 1: Gather","","Collect data across every dimension a WvW commander needs to review this squad. Call tools to gather:","","1. **Fight overview** - fight list, outcomes, K/D, durations. Identify which fights were wins, which were losses, and the damage delta per fight.","2. **Composition** - squad class composition, player roles, and enemy composition. Note comp mismatches (too few healers, no stab source, etc.).","3. **Offense** - top damage dealers, DPS, spike damage, CC/breakbar damage. Identify burst windows and damage gaps.","4. **Defense** - deaths, downs, damage taken, downstate analysis. Identify where and when the squad collapsed.","5. **Boons** - squad boon uptime (Stability, Quickness, Might, Alacrity), stab performance, boon leaderboards. Identify stab gaps and boon drops.","6. **Support** - cleanses, strips, healing, resurrects, distance to tag. Identify support gaps and positioning issues.","","Call the relevant tools now. Cross-reference across dimensions: e.g. if deaths spiked in a fight, check whether Stability dropped in that same fight, or whether healers were out of position (distance to tag).","","After you have gathered enough data across all six dimensions, write a concise summary of the key findings - the patterns, outliers, and cross-references a commander would highlight. This summary will be shared with six section-specific reviews, so cover all dimensions."].join(`
`)}const pg={fight_overview:["## Section: Fight Overview","","Review the overall arc of the raid: how many fights, win/loss record, K/D trend across fights, and damage delta per fight.","Focus on:","- Which fights were clean wins and which were messy losses.","- Whether the squad trended better or worse across the raid (learning curve vs fatigue).","- The single biggest swing fight (best trade or worst collapse) and what made it different.","","Write your fight-overview callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
