`),offense:["## Section: Offense","","Review the squad's damage output and burst execution.","Focus on:","- Total and per-fight damage, DPS, and spike peaks. Who carried, who lagged.","- Whether burst windows aligned with enemy Stability gaps and Stability drops.","- Down-to-kill conversion: were downs finished or did enemies rally? Use the Kill:Down ratio.","- Synthesize from the child section callouts (spike damage, outgoing conditions, damage breakdown) when available — build on their specific findings rather than re-analyzing raw data from scratch.","","Write your offense callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),spike_damage:["## Section: Spike Damage","","Review the squad's burst execution: peak hit values, 1s/5s/30s spike windows, and whether bombs landed at the right time.","Focus on:","- Squad spike peaks per fight: what were the highest burst windows, and did they align with enemy Stability drops? Spiking into 15+ stab stacks is a wasted bomb.","- Burst vs sustained ratio: is the squad a one-bomb comp (needs that one bomb to land) or sustained pressure? One-bomb squads must land the bomb — if spike peaks are low in losses, the bomb whiffed.","- Down conversion from spikes: did burst windows create downs and kills, or were they absorbed by enemy mitigation? High spike damage with low kill conversion means the enemy out-mitigated or out-healed the bomb.","- Spike timing across the raid: are peaks consistent fight-to-fight, or did they drop off (fatigue, cooldown mismanagement)? Cite the fight indices and numbers.","","Write your spike-damage callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),conditions_outgoing:["## Section: Outgoing Conditions","","Review the squad's condition pressure: which conditions dominate output, stacking efficiency, and coverage across the squad.","Focus on:","- Condition mix: which condition types account for the most squad damage? Is condi pressure concentrated in one type (good for stacking) or spread thin across many?","- Condition uptime on enemies: are damaging conditions maintained throughout fights, or do they drop off between engages? A condition that drops to zero between bombs means the squad is re-applying from scratch every time.","- Stacking efficiency: are damaging conditions reaching high stacks, or being refreshed too early before cap? Early refreshes waste GCDs that could be damage or cleanse.","- Squad-wide coverage: is condi output spread across multiple squad members, or concentrated in a single source? A single-source condi output is a single point of failure — if that source is focused, all condi pressure drops.","","Write your outgoing-conditions callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),damage_breakdown:["## Section: Damage Breakdown","","Review the squad's skill-level damage distribution: which skills carry the squad's output and whether burst skills are being used at the right frequency.","Focus on:","- Skill distribution: does the squad's damage concentrate in a few high-impact burst skills (good specialization), or spread across many low-impact skills (no rotation focus)? Cite the top skills and their damage share.","- Burst skill frequency: are key burst skills being used on cooldown, or held too long? A skill used once in a 90-second fight that should be used twice is a lost burst window.","- Skill mix differences between high-damage and low-damage fights: what skills appear in the squad's top output during wins that disappear during losses? That gap is the coaching point.","- Do NOT name individual players or classes. Focus on the squad-level skill distribution and what it reveals about rotation discipline.","","Write your damage-breakdown callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),defense:["## Section: Defense","","Review the squad's survivability and collapse points.","Focus on:","- Deaths, downs, and damage taken per fight. Identify the collapse fights.","- Downstate analysis: were downs revived, rallied, or finished? Did the squad trade or feed?","- Incoming damage spikes and whether Stability / cleanses were up during enemy bombs.","- Positioning: distance to tag for players who died - were they isolated?","","Write your defense callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),boons:["## Section: Boons","","Review the squad's boon uptime and Stability performance.","Focus on:","- Stability uptime per fight and per group. Identify fights and time windows where stab dropped.","- Quickness, Might, Alacrity, Fury uptime - were DPS players getting their buffs?","- Stab performance drilldown: stab stacks vs incoming damage vs party deaths.",'- Boon generation: focus on the SQUAD-LEVEL metric. "Stability uptime was 20% in Fight 5" is useful. Do NOT say "class X must provide more Stability" — instead, report the actual boon generation numbers and the squad-level gap, regardless of class.',"","Write your boons callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),support:["## Section: Support","","Review the squad's support output: cleansing, stripping, healing, and positioning.","Focus on:","- Cleanse and boon-strip totals. Were condi-bombs cleansed? Were enemy boons stripped before bombs?","- Healing output and HPS. Were healers in range (distance to tag) during fights?","- Resurrects - were downs picked up, or left to rally the enemy?","- Support gaps: identify players whose support output (cleanses, strips, healing, boon generation) was low relative to the squad. Judge by their actual numbers, not by class name.","","Write your support callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
`),commander_stats:["## Section: Commander Stats","","Review the commander's performance and its impact on the squad.","Focus on:","- Commander deaths: how many fights did the tag die, and did the squad collapse after tag death?","- Push timing: were pushes called at the right moments (enemy stab down, squad boons up)?","- Tag movement: was the tag kiting too much (squad can't follow) or too static (easy target)?","- Target conversion: did the squad focus the right targets after tag calls?","","Write your commander-stats callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
