`),mitigation:["## Section: Damage Mitigation","","Review the squad's defensive play: evades, blocks, dodges, and damage avoided.","Focus on:","- Total mitigated damage per player. Who is mitigating well, and who is eating damage raw?","- Evade and block counts. Are DPS players dodging enemy bombs, or standing in them?","- Mitigation relative to damage taken: high mitigation + high damage taken means the player is in the fight but surviving. Low mitigation + high damage taken means they are a liability.","- Compare mitigation between wins and losses - did the squad mitigate better in wins?","","Write your mitigation callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
