`),boon_timeline:["## Section: Boon Timeline","","Review the temporal boon data — when boons were applied, when they dropped, and whether applications were wasted.","Focus on:","- Gap duration and frequency: how long were key boons (Stability, Quickness, Might, Alacrity) missing within fights, and how often per fight? A 3-second quickness drop once is recoverable; a 10-second Might/Alacrity gap every fight is a rotation problem.","- Overwrite waste: if multiple sources are overwriting stacking boons (applying the same boon when it is already at cap), flag the specific boon and roughly how many applications were wasted — those are wasted GCDs that could have been damage or cleanse.","- Timing alignment: did boon application line up with enemy bombs (good) or happen during downtime (wasted)?","- Do NOT just re-state uptime percentages from the boons callout. The value here is WHEN and WHY gaps happened, not the aggregate number.","","Write your boon-timeline callout now, following the format constraints."].join(`
